PROJECT

Ismael & Rayan (A)

Domain: AI and Machine learining

Data: 
Tabular: Rows and columns
Images: group of pixels
Text: words converted to numbers
Time series: values ordered in time
Audio: sounds signals as numbers

Operations:
Load data: read information
Clean data: remove irrelevant information
Transform data: convert categories to numbers
Split data: separate information
Train the model: the model learn patterns
Evaluate the model: measure how good the predictions are
Predict: use the model with new information

Input/Output:
Input: features and labels, new features and prediction with the reality
Output: Trained model, a prediction and performance result

Decisions:
What problem do I want to solve? 
What data do I need? 
Which algorithm should I use? 
How do I measure success?



